          <p>The corpus is embedded once during the build and shipped as quantised vectors. Browser search is a local dot-product calculation, so a search query is not sent to a server.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-row">
          <span>One model, both sides</span>
          <p>The build script and browser use the same MiniLM checkpoint. Document and query embeddings therefore occupy the same vector space.</p>
